1. lucide — https://lucide.dev/
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The browser workbench shipped in `apps/core/web/app/` contains a set of SVG icon
paths in `apps/core/web/app/lib/icons.mjs`. Those paths reproduce shapes from
lucide (https://lucide.dev/), a project distributed under the ISC License.

No lucide JavaScript package, font file, or build artifact is bundled: only the
path geometry is reproduced, in the project's own file. 96 of the 101 icons in
that file are lucide-derived; the remaining five are described in section 2.

The license text below is reproduced verbatim from the lucide project
(https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide, file `LICENSE`), including the
