2. Five elements (wuxing) material icons — `wx-mu` / `wx-huo` / `wx-tu` /
   `wx-jin` / `wx-shui`
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These five filled silhouettes (tree / flame / hill / metal ingot / water drop)
were drawn for this project and are covered by the project's Apache 2.0
license. Their earlier stroked drafts were taken from the corresponding lucide
icons and re-drawn as solid shapes; the lucide attribution in section 1
therefore also applies to them.

