3. plotly.js — https://plotly.com/javascript/
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The browser workbench's "evolution" page (self-evolution ledger trends) draws its
charts with plotly.js, distributed under the MIT License.

The vendored file is the **basic** partial bundle of plotly.js v2.35.2:

    apps/core/web/app/vendor/plotly-basic.min.js
    apps/core/web/app/vendor/plotly-basic.min.js.LICENSE.txt
    apps/core/web/app/vendor/plotly-LICENSE.txt

It is served by this repository from `web/app/vendor/` — no CDN, no network
access, no account, no runtime dependency. The bundle is loaded on demand
(only when the evolution page is opened), never on the other pages.

