5. Everything else
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apart from the vendored plotly.js bundle described above, the browser
workbench is dependency-free: no JavaScript bundle, no webfont, no CDN
reference, no external asset. Typefaces are taken from the host operating
system's font stack.

